  "long_audio_and_timestamps": {
    "original_wrapper": "Normalizes complete audio, splits near 1200-second boundaries without alignment or 180-second boundaries with alignment, chooses low-energy cuts within a +/-5-second search, records offsets, and concatenates chunk texts. Short tails may be zero-padded; these are processing chunks, not speech/word boundaries.",
